  "lang": "en",
  "description": [
    "A member of the class of pyrazoles that is 1<em>H</em>-pyrazole which is substituted at positions 1, 3 and 5 by 4-sulfamoylphenyl, trifluoromethyl and <em>p</em>-tolyl groups, respectively. A cyclooxygenase-2 inhibitor, it is used in the treatment of arthritis."
  ],
